* Voltage Source
Vsig 7 0 DC 0

* Resistors
Rsig 7 3 Rsig_value
Rs 2 0 Rs_value
RL 5 4 RL_value

* Capacitors
Cgd 5 6 Cgd_value
Cgs 3 2 Cgs_value
CL 6 9 CL_value

* NMOS Transistor (Assumption: NMOS with drain at node 5, gate at node 3, source at node 2)
M1 5 3 2 2 NMOS_MODEL

* .MODEL statements for transistors (add actual parameters)
.model NMOS_MODEL NMOS(...)